 {
  "where": "whats-new",
  "t": "1280-rm",
  "text": "Flags in Footle, and six countries find their home. In Footle a player's country used to show as a bare word in three spots: the example in How to play, the line under the answer in a five-puzzle run, and the Nation box in the player details. All three carry the flag now, same as everywhere else on the site. And in Club Manager the nationality filter on the Market had a leftover group called Elsewhere. Niger, Namibia, Mauritius, South Sudan, Turkmenistan and French Guiana were sitting in it because nobody had told the game where they play their football. Each one now sits under its own confederation with everybody else, and Elsewhere is gone.",
